            "sentence_id": "sentence_fcdc03178a1ddc209508d444",
            "source_text": "Correspondingly, the gates at time step $t$\nare defined as follows: the input gate is $\\mathbf{I}_t \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times h}$, the forget gate is $\\mathbf{F}_t \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times h}$, and the output gate is $\\mathbf{O}_t \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times h}$.",
